cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "oeis-lean: machine-checked proofs of OEIS conjectures in Lean 4"
message: "If you use these proofs, please cite this repository."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Wiktorowicz
    given-names: Rafał
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/braun-systems/oeis-lean"
abstract: >-
  Formal, kernel-checked proofs of conjectures recorded in the On-Line
  Encyclopedia of Integer Sequences. The first entry proves Stoll's
  recurrence a(n) = a(n-1) + a(n-3) for n >= 12 for OEIS A252864, and
  that the threshold is sharp. No external libraries are used.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - formal verification
  - OEIS
  - integer sequences
